@guide A_Hellfire
@name Hellfire Peninsula (Honor Hold)
@faction Alliance
@levels 58-62
@zone Hellfire Peninsula
@chapter Outland
@desc Through the Dark Portal to Honor Hold. Covers the Stair of Destiny, the Legion forge camps, Expedition Point, Shatter Point, the Zeth'Gor and Pools of Aggonar quests, Temple of Telhamat and the Cenarion Post. Hellfire Ramparts quests are optional group content.
@next A_Zangarmarsh

